WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.066
- [Voiceover] I bought a samurai sword.

00:00:02.066 --> 00:00:03.820
Didn't even remember until I received

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:05.136
and opened the package.

00:00:05.136 --> 00:00:06.265
That was a fun day.

00:00:06.265 --> 00:00:07.449
(whoosh)

00:00:07.449 --> 00:00:08.449
(hinge squeaks)

00:00:08.449 --> 00:00:09.843
("All Night Polka")

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:14.668
(beer pours)

00:00:14.668 --> 00:00:18.516
("All Night Polka")

00:00:18.814 --> 00:00:21.315
- [Voiceover] $180 worth of fake urine.

00:00:21.315 --> 00:00:23.866
My brother and I drunk-discussed
it for about an hour.

00:00:23.866 --> 00:00:26.344
In the end, it seemed like a good idea.

00:00:26.344 --> 00:00:28.556
- [Voiceover] A circus-themed
tent for my cat.

00:00:28.556 --> 00:00:29.320
(meow)

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:30.731
It has a tiny flag on top.

00:00:30.731 --> 00:00:33.168
- [Voiceover] I bought a
six cup food processor,

00:00:33.168 --> 00:00:35.758
a pair of knee-high bumblebee socks,

00:00:35.758 --> 00:00:38.329
and a coloring book called
"Dinosaurs with Jobs."

00:00:38.329 --> 00:00:39.589
- [Voiceover] Ordered an eight foot

00:00:39.589 --> 00:00:41.285
cardboard cut out of Will Ferrell

00:00:41.285 --> 00:00:44.002
and arranged for it to be
sent to my mother's house.

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:46.225
- [Voiceover] A friend of
mine has gotten absurdly drunk

00:00:46.225 --> 00:00:47.844
and ordered things on Amazon.

00:00:47.844 --> 00:00:49.178
She likes to be surprised.

00:00:49.178 --> 00:00:52.104
12 vibrators later and she's
finally started canceling

00:00:52.104 --> 00:00:56.033
the orders because it is
literally always a vibrator.

00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:57.478
- [Voiceover] I woke up one morning after

00:00:57.478 --> 00:01:00.028
a hell of a happy hour to
see an email confirmation

00:01:00.028 --> 00:01:04.229
from around 3:30 AM for my
purchase of fencing lessons.

00:01:04.229 --> 00:01:05.169
(swords clink)

00:01:05.169 --> 00:01:06.683
- [Voiceover] My best friend and I woke up

00:01:06.683 --> 00:01:08.531
one morning to an email confirming

00:01:08.531 --> 00:01:10.831
our purchase of tickets to see Hanson.

00:01:10.831 --> 00:01:11.283
(screams)

00:01:11.283 --> 00:01:13.091
I'll admit I love Hanson but this was

00:01:13.091 --> 00:01:15.622
the worst show due to the other fans.

00:01:15.622 --> 00:01:17.997
No one should have an "MMMBop" tattoo.

00:01:17.997 --> 00:01:19.116
No one.

00:01:19.116 --> 00:01:20.944
- [Voiceover] One
Saturday night, I decided

00:01:20.944 --> 00:01:22.789
that instead of going to
church in the morning,

00:01:22.789 --> 00:01:26.543
I would order a package of
1,000 communion wafers online.

00:01:26.543 --> 00:01:29.487
- [Voiceover] A Nicholas Cage
as Mona Lisa iPhone case.

00:01:29.487 --> 00:01:32.768
I was so proud of drunk
me when it arrived.

00:01:32.768 --> 00:01:36.320
("All Night Polka")

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:38.807
(whoosh)

00:01:38.807 --> 00:01:39.872
(hinge squeaks)

